#### 142. 环形链表 II
https://leetcode.cn/problems/linked-list-cycle-ii/
做法和数学证明已经在 [[#141. 环形链表|141. 环形链表]]中说明
```cpp
class Solution {
public:
    ListNode *detectCycle(ListNode *head) {
        ListNode* fast = head;
        ListNode* slow = head;
        while(fast != nullptr && fast->next != nullptr){
            fast = fast->next->next;
            slow= slow->next;
            if(fast == slow){ // first meet
                while(slow != head){
                    slow = slow->next;
                    head = head->next;
                }
                return slow;
            }
        }
        return nullptr;
    }
};
```

